        <mxCell id="wzzd5CX_dV33YkVSsU24-45" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 48px;&quot;&gt;Aging clock and in-silico perturbation&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;Aging model performance:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;- scores need to be benchmarked against Wenchau&#39;s model&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;SLE:&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- all cell types show age acceleration. This pattern is for young&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;Covid:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- only MONO and NK show sig age acceleration&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- considering that there was no overlap in aging and disease TFs, this could indicate the multivariate model&#39;s advantage&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;Drug perturbation:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- the model is only able to show the Rux. effect on MONO. We should see some effects on other cell types (check the unsig results)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-7906" y="3654" width="928" height="534" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
